372 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (This Software Requirements Specification \(SRS\) document defines the requirements for the PawCare -Animal Rescue and Care System. The system is designed to assist users in addressing the challenges of helping injured or lost animals by providing tools for managing reports, offering first aid guidance, and connecting with rescue centers)
/E (This Software Requirements Specification \(SRS\) document defines the requirements for the PawCare -Animal Rescue and Care System. The system is designed to assist users in addressing the challenges of helping injured or lost animals by providing tools for managing reports, offering first aid guidance, and connecting with rescue centers)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
