374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (This project targets individuals who encounter injured or lost animals, providing immediate access to nearby animal care centers, vets, and first aid information. )
/E (This project targets individuals who encounter injured or lost animals, providing immediate access to nearby animal care centers, vets, and first aid information. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
375 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The application will serve communities in densely populated areas where animal accidents or neglect are more common. While no exact tool currently exists, an article mentioned the planned launch of a similar app in Pakistan in 2020\(Source\), but it still has not been released, highlighting a gap that this project aims to fill.)
/E (The application will serve communities in densely populated areas where animal accidents or neglect are more common. While no exact tool currently exists, an article mentioned the planned launch of a similar app in Pakistan in 2020\(Source\), but it still has not been released, highlighting a gap that this project aims to fill.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
