385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Animals often suffer due to accidents or abandonment in populated regions, with limited immediate help available. Many individuals who wish to assist are hindered by a lack of resources or knowledge, resulting in extended suffering for the animals. Additionally, there is often no streamlined process to reconnect lost pets with their owners or find homes for rescued animals.)
/E (Animals often suffer due to accidents or abandonment in populated regions, with limited immediate help available. Many individuals who wish to assist are hindered by a lack of resources or knowledge, resulting in extended suffering for the animals. Additionally, there is often no streamlined process to reconnect lost pets with their owners or find homes for rescued animals.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
