<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (PawCare is a new, self-contained product designed specifically to address the lack of a streamlined solution for animal rescue and care in urban areas. Unlike any existing tools, it fills a gap in the market where no similar system currently provides combined functionalities for locating care centers, offering first aid guidance, and reconnecting lost pets with owners.)
/E (PawCare is a new, self-contained product designed specifically to address the lack of a streamlined solution for animal rescue and care in urban areas. Unlike any existing tools, it fills a gap in the market where no similar system currently provides combined functionalities for locating care centers, offering first aid guidance, and reconnecting lost pets with owners.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
